  "rationale": "FieldsMatchClasses constrains all allocated field targets, including fields hidden by a view. PendingValues records temporary object/type pairs. Realizes requires admissible environment and pending types, pending-inclusive structural ownership, matching declared fields, exact local domains and satisfaction of each occupied local/pending value. The separately defined read and satisfaction predicates supply the local positive/negative constraints. The unit does not require a whole view for every object.",
